<title>RUSSIA: Russia preliminary H1 trade surplus $11.6 bln.</title>
<headline>Russia preliminary H1 trade surplus $11.6 bln.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia posted a trade surplus of $11.6 billion in the first six months of this year, according to preliminary data issued by the State Statistics Committee.</p>
<p>Exports were $41.2 billion, which was 1.9 percent less than in the first half of 1996, and imports were $29.6 billion, which was 5.3 percent less than a year earlier.</p>
<p>Detailed figures for June will be issued later this month.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
